          "rhyme": "iN",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Uh, um, of course, \"Frenz,\" like, songs like that that are a little more challenging",
          "rhyme": "iN",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "You know what I mean? Uh, uh, um, um",
          "rhyme": "Om",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "\"Vomitspit\" is the last joint I put on there, kind of speed I went on there after the leak",
          "rhyme": "Ek",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "So, new, new joint",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "All right, cool, anything else particularly about you that people should know?",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "That kinda, you know, what I'm sayin'?",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "Nope, I'll let you know, the Villain ain't never gon' quit",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "Thеre's gon' be more and morе coming out, so",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "You know, ready your headsets and your um, and your speakers",
          "rhyme": "9R",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "Make sure your monitors are in good working order",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "When you put the CD and it don't bust it and shit",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "You know what I mean?",
          "rhyme": "in",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "Cool",
          "rhyme": "ul",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
